Hey team,

Infrastructure update:

 - Provisioned 3 additional API server instances for cutover headroom
 - Redis cluster upgraded to 7.2 (needed for the new caching layer)
 - Set up a dedicated Kafka topic for v2 event streaming
 - Created separate CloudWatch alarms for v2 endpoints:
   * 5xx rate > 0.1% -> PagerDuty alert
   * p99 latency > 500ms -> Slack warning
   * Request rate drop > 30% -> Slack warning

The staging environment is now a 1:1 replica of prod in terms of
infrastructure. I ran a chaos test (killed 1 of 3 API nodes) and
failover happened in <2 seconds with zero dropped requests.

- Dave

